<title>ROMANIA: Earth tremor shakes eastern Romania.</title>
<headline>Earth tremor shakes eastern Romania.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earth tremor shook eastern Romania on Sunday but no casualties or damage was reported, state television said.</p>
<p>It quoted the National Earth Physics Institute as saying the tremor, with a preliminary magnitude of 4.3 degrees on the Richter open-ended scale, was centred in the mountain region of Vrancea, 300 km (190 miles) northeast of Bucharest.</p>
</text>
